Dia pasti ditahan tak lama lagi.

01:16:35.382 --> 01:16:36.550
Kanak-kanak itu?

01:16:37.676 --> 01:16:38.510
Dia selamat.

01:16:42.681 --> 01:16:44.808
En. Kim pula?

01:16:53.317 --> 01:16:56.903
Dia sedang dibedah
