01:21:09.030 --> 01:21:10.574
Saya faham perasaan awak.

01:21:11.449 --> 01:21:13.535
Tapi awak sudah tercedera.

01:21:14.870 --> 01:21:15.996
Jangan cedera lagi.

01:21:18.373 --> 01:21:19.541
