Ia pasti berguna.

01:23:16.157 --> 01:23:16.992
Okey.

01:23:19.869 --> 01:23:20.704
Hei.

01:23:21.371 --> 01:23:22.706
Awak yakin boleh buka?

01:23:22.789 --> 01:23:23.957
